{"pageProps":{"meta":{"id":"obsidian:free-api-groq-text-20261102","title":"Groq免费文字API实测：同一份订单，有的算对，有的算出4530","date":"2026-11-03","updated":"2026-11-03","summary":"同一订单的正确答案与加总错误，附接法。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-资源分享","name":"资源分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["资源分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-免费API","name":"免费API","color":"default"}],"image":"/obsidian-assets/free-api-groq-text-20261102/cover-b2f332d8ca.jpg","coverBlockId":null,"slug":"free-api-groq-text-20261102","legacyPaths":[],"lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"article","discoveryName":"Groq免费文字API实测：同一份订单，有的算对，有的算出4530","discoveryCategory":null,"discoveryStage":null,"discoveryUrl":null,"source":"markdown","fixedProductFooter":true},"markdownHtml":"<blockquote>\n<p><strong>摘要</strong>\n两秒拿到订单结果，也保留一次加总错误\n黑粉科技 · 2026年11月2日资料与实测</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>同一份订单，Groq上的gpt-oss-20b在1.977秒后给出正确明细；换成allam-2-7b，小计都列对了，总价却写成4530元。免费接口值不值得接，先看这两个回答，比只看平台介绍更直接。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/free-api-groq-text-20261102/image-groq-home-2d5bba25db.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/07f321cd61e3451bfdb7ba9e-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/07f321cd61e3451bfdb7ba9e-780.webp 780w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/free-api-groq-text-20261102/image-groq-home-2d5bba25db.png\" alt=\"Groq官方介绍\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"780\" height=\"910\"></picture></a></p>\n<h2>订单很简单，答案也能手算</h2>\n<p>我让模型从一段中文里提取商品、数量、单价、小计、运费、优惠和总价，按固定JSON字段返回。JSON就像一张每格都有名字的表单，程序才能继续读取“总价”这格；少字段、半截内容和改了商品名，都会影响后面的处理。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-本次真实输入\">这是自制测试数据。只返回JSON，不加代码围栏。订单：设备A每台1200元，买2台；设备B每台350元，买3台；运费80元；优惠130元。输出字段items（包含name、quantity、unit_price、subtotal），shipping、discount、total。所有金额用整数。\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-手工标准答案\">1200 × 2 + 350 × 3 + 80 − 130 = 3400（元）\n</code></pre>\n<p>本次用已有账户，经本机黑粉盒子把请求转发给对应平台。计时从本机发出请求到收完回答，包含网络和服务等待；每个型号的订单题只跑了一次。账户配置为免费档，未读取最终账单。</p>\n<h2>gpt-oss-20b：明细、总价都对上</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-JSON\">{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;设备A&quot;,&quot;quantity&quot;:2,&quot;unit_price&quot;:1200,&quot;subtotal&quot;:2400},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;设备B&quot;,&quot;quantity&quot;:3,&quot;unit_price&quot;:350,&quot;subtotal&quot;:1050}],&quot;shipping&quot;:80,&quot;discount&quot;:130,&quot;total&quot;:3400}\n</code></pre>\n<p>原始返回</p>\n<p>这份回答把设备A和设备B的名称、小计以及3400元总价都写对了。再让它把四条技术要求改成两句话，0.956秒收完，保留了每天重置、一次一图、失败提示和自己申请密钥四项信息。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-中文改写原始返回\">每天免费额度重置，每个任务仅能生成一张图。若生成失败会保留错误信息，使用前请自行申请密钥。\n</code></pre>\n<h2>同平台换型号，结果并不一样</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>请求型号／任务</th>\n<th>完整耗时</th>\n<th>实际返回</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>openai/gpt-oss-20b&lt;br&gt;订单</td>\n<td>1.977秒</td>\n<td>200；JSON字段及金额与标准答案一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>openai/gpt-oss-20b&lt;br&gt;改写</td>\n<td>0.956秒</td>\n<td>200；已返回，四项信息保留</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>allam-2-7b&lt;br&gt;订单</td>\n<td>0.641秒</td>\n<td>200；返回了内容，但总价错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>groq/compound&lt;br&gt;订单</td>\n<td>0.307秒</td>\n<td>404；调用失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>groq/compound-mini&lt;br&gt;订单</td>\n<td>0.305秒</td>\n<td>404；调用失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>openai/gpt-oss-120b&lt;br&gt;订单</td>\n<td>2.313秒</td>\n<td>200；JSON字段及金额与标准答案一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>qwen/qwen3.8-27b&lt;br&gt;订单</td>\n<td>1.491秒</td>\n<td>200；JSON字段及金额与标准答案一致</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<blockquote>\n<p>本机经黑粉盒子转发；每行一次请求，非多轮平均。耗时包含网络和上游等待。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/free-api-groq-text-20261102/image-groq-chart-f812a4193c.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/ac3d7748c83104778c5b657c-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/ac3d7748c83104778c5b657c-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/free-api-groq-text-20261102/image-groq-chart-f812a4193c.png\" alt=\"订单请求实测数据\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1500\" height=\"855\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>gpt-oss-120b和qwen/qwen3.8-27b也把订单做对了。本轮分别用了2.313秒和1.491秒；这只是同一道小题各跑一次的记录，不能从这张表推出所有任务的性能排行。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-JSON\">{\n  &quot;items&quot;: [\n    {\n      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Device A&quot;,\n      &quot;quantity&quot;: 2,\n      &quot;unit_price&quot;: 1200,\n      &quot;subtotal&quot;: 2400\n    },\n    {\n      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Device B&quot;,\n      &quot;quantity&quot;: 3,\n      &quot;unit_price&quot;: 350,\n      &quot;subtotal&quot;: 1050\n    }\n  ],\n  &quot;shipping&quot;: 80,\n  &quot;discount&quot;: 130,\n  &quot;total&quot;: 4530\n} \n</code></pre>\n<p>allam-2-7b原始返回</p>\n<p>4530和正确答案相差1130元。回答里的2400、1050、80、130都在，却没有算出对应的总和。要把模型接进订单工具，金额仍应交给确定的计算代码，模型负责提取。让它直接给一个看着工整的JSON，再把total入账，出错时会很安静。</p>\n<p>两个compound旧配置返回404，本次没有拿到答案；不要在客户端保留一个历史名字，就当它今天仍可用。</p>\n<h2>去哪里领密钥，客户端填哪几项</h2>\n<p>先打开<a href=\"https://console.groq.com/keys\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://console.groq.com/keys\">Groq控制台密钥页</a>，创建自己的密钥。支持兼容接口的客户端通常填三项：基础地址<a href=\"https://api.groq.com/openai/v1\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://api.groq.com/openai/v1\">https://api.groq.com/openai/v1</a>、密钥、精确模型名openai/gpt-oss-20b。模型名前面的groq/是本轮本地路由前缀，直连Groq时不要照抄这个前缀。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-官方SDK接法示例\">from groq import Groq\n\nclient = Groq()  # 从环境变量GROQ_API_KEY读取\nresult = client.chat.completions.create(\n    model=&quot;openai/gpt-oss-20b&quot;,\n    messages=[{&quot;role&quot;: &quot;user&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;把这句话改得更容易懂：每天重置免费额度。&quot;}],\n)\nprint(result.choices[0].message.content)\n</code></pre>\n<p>按官方快速开始安装groq包再运行。示例默认读取环境变量，密钥别写进要分享的脚本或截图。实际实测使用的是已有免费账户；这段SDK代码用于说明直连接法，没有额外发出一次重复请求。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/free-api-groq-text-20261102/image-groq-limits-f67aa6f5b1.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/6a843b1682e51b56bbdb0822-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/6a843b1682e51b56bbdb0822-820.webp 820w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/free-api-groq-text-20261102/image-groq-limits-f67aa6f5b1.png\" alt=\"官方限流页面\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"820\" height=\"1415\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>免费能用多少，要看当前账户和具体型号。官方限额页还列出Developer基础限额，不能把整张表当成每个免费用户的待遇。遇到429先等返回建议的时间，避免连续刷新把一个任务变成一串失败请求。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>引用：我的判断</strong>\n这次的gpt-oss-20b适合先试信息整理和中文改写：两道任务完成，完整请求都很短。涉及钱和固定格式，提取后仍要校验字段、自己计算。平台快不快与任务对不对，分别看结果。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>主要查证来源</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://console.groq.com/docs/overview\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://console.groq.com/docs/overview\">Groq官网介绍</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://console.groq.com/keys\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://console.groq.com/keys\">创建Groq密钥</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://console.groq.com/docs/quickstart\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://console.groq.com/docs/quickstart\">Groq快速开始</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://console.groq.com/docs/rate-limits\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://console.groq.com/docs/rate-limits\">Groq官方限流</a></li>\n</ul>\n","relatedPosts":[{"id":"obsidian:free-api-image-directory-20261102","rawId":"obsidian:free-api-image-directory-20261102","slug":"free-api-image-directory-20261102","legacyPaths":[],"title":"免费绘图API怎么选：免密、周期额度和新人试用资料目录","date":"2026-11-03","updated":"2026-11-03","summary":"先看实际原图，再按免费来源选绘